          "content": "**Q3. Now, a unit is divided into 8 equal parts. Write the appropriate fractions in your notebook.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.128,
            0.27,
            0.161
          ],
          "content": "Ans. $\\frac { 1 } { 8 } , \\frac { 2 } { 8 } , \\frac { 3 } { 8 }$ ,… •"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.196,
            0.234,
            0.215
          ],
          "content": "**Page no. 160**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.224,
            0.233,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.249,
            0.628,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": "**Q1. On a number line, draw lines of lengths** $\\frac{1}{10}, \\frac{3}{10}$ **and** $\\frac { 4 } { 5 } .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.292,
            0.161,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": "Ans."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
